      "finding": "An alternative pole remains possible; no unique orientation is claimed. AKARI thermal effective diameter provides only an explicit volume-scale approximation. Alternative archive solutions: model 579, pole ['23', '-28'], [Model 579](https://damit.cuni.cz/projects/damit/asteroid_models/view/579) The live DAMIT export lists these other models for this target: 579: pole (23°, -28°), 8.29055 h, version 2013-02-11. These are archive alternatives, not necessarily newly released models or preferred replacements. Comparing their source methods and any pole-specific calibration remains necessary before changing the selected mesh.",
